<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Insurance Forms</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .header-title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .sub-header { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .label { font-weight: normal; display: inline-block; width: 150px; }
  .input-field { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-width: 150px; }
  .radio-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
  .table-row td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .table-header th { text-align: left; padding-bottom: 5px; }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Lincoln Financial Group</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Lincoln Life & Annuity Company of New York</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">PO Box 2609, Omaha, NE 68103-2609</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Toll Free (800) 423-2765 Fax (877) 843-3950</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">LincolnFinancial.com</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">disabilityclaims@lfg.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 class="header-title">Long Term Disability Claim Statement Of Employee</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div>
        <p>1. Your Information</p>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <p>First Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ first_name }}</span></p>
          <p>Last Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ last_name }}</span></p>
          <p>Street Address: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ street_address }}</span></p>
          <p>City: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ city }}</span></p>
          <p>State: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ state }}</span></p>
          <p>Zip Code: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
          <p>Social Security Number: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ ssn }}</span></p>
          <p>Date of Birth: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ dob }}</span></p>
          <p>Male <input type="radio" name="gender" value="Male"> Female <input type="radio" name="gender" value="Female"></p>
          <p>Email Address: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ email_address }}</span></p>
          <p>Phone Number: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h2 class="header-title">2. Your Employer</h2>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <p>Employer Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ employer_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Job Title: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ job_title }}</span></p>
      <p>Group ID: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ group_id }}</span></p>
      <p>Policy Number: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ policy_number }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h2 class="header-title">3. Reason for inability to work</h2>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p>Description of Sickness, Injury or Pregnancy: <span class="input-field" style="width: 700px;">{{ reason_description }}</span></p>
      <p>Injury work related? Yes <input type="radio" name="injury_related" value="Yes"> No <input type="radio" name="injury_related" value="No"></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h2 class="header-title">4. Other Income Being Received</h2>
    <table class="table-row" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
      <thead>
        <tr class="table-header">
          <th style="width: 20%;">Source</th>
          <th style="width: 15%;">Amount $</th>
          <th style="width: 25%;">Date Began</th>
          <th style="width: 25%;">Date Will Terminate</th>
          <th style="width: 15%;">Date Applied For</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for item in other_income %}
        <tr class="table-row">
          <td><span data-field="other_income[{{ loop.index0 }}].source">{{ item.source }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="other_income[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ item.amount }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="other_income[{{ loop.index0 }}].date_began">{{ item.date_began }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="other_income[{{ loop.index0 }}].date_terminate">{{ item.date_terminate }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="other_income[{{ loop.index0 }}].date_applied">{{ item.date_applied }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h2 class="header-title">5. Who is your treating health care provider?</h2>
    <p>This is your primary health care professional. Please have them complete the <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Attending Physician's Statement</span>. If you have additional health care providers, please also complete the Treating Medical Professional form.</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p>Physician's Full Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ physician_full_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Phone Number: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ physician_phone_number }}</span></p>
      <p>Street Address: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ physician_street_address }}</span></p>
      <p>City: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ physician_city }}</span></p>
      <p>State: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ physician_state }}</span></p>
      <p>Zip Code: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ physician_zip_code }}</span></p>
      <p>Fax Number: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ physician_fax_number }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h2 class="header-title">6. Account for Direct Deposit</h2>
    <table class="table-row" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
      <thead>
        <tr class="table-header">
          <th style="width: 25%;">Bank Name</th>
          <th style="width: 25%;">Routing Number</th>
          <th style="width: 25%;">Account Number</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for item in direct_deposit_accounts %}
        <tr class="table-row">
          <td><span data-field="direct_deposit_accounts[{{ loop.index0 }}].bank_name">{{ item.bank_name }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="direct_deposit_accounts[{{ loop.index0 }}].routing_number">{{ item.routing_number }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="direct_deposit_accounts[{{ loop.index0 }}].account_number">{{ item.account_number }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>The above statements are true and complete to the best of my knowledge and belief. I have read and understand Fraud Warning Statements. I have completed and attached the Authorization for Release of Information.</p>
    <p><strong>New York.</strong> Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud any insurance company or other person files an application for insurance or statement of claim containing any materially false information or conceals for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact material thereto commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime and subject to a civil penalty not to exceed five thousand dollars and the stated value of the claim for each such violation.</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
      <div>
        <p>Signature</p>
        <p>Print Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ signature_print_name }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Date</p>
        <p><span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ signature_date }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Lincoln Financial Group</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Lincoln Life & Annuity Company of New York</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">PO Box 2609, Omaha, NE 68103-2609</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Toll Free (800) 423-2765 Fax (877) 843-3950</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">LincolnFinancial.com</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">disabilityclaims@lfg.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 class="header-title">Illness or Injury Supplemental Questionnaire</h2>
    <p>Instructions: Please answer the questions to the best of your ability and sign and date below.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>1. Is someone else responsible for your illness/injury? Yes <input type="radio" name="resp_illness" value="Yes"> No <input type="radio" name="resp_illness" value="No"></p>
    <p>2. Are you making a claim against anyone or any insurance company other than Lincoln Financial Group? Yes <input type="radio" name="claim_against" value="Yes"> No <input type="radio" name="claim_against" value="No"></p>
    <p>If you answered yes to either question above, please answer the following questions:</p>
    <p>3. Please describe in detail the cause of your illness or injury: <span class="input-field" style="width: 95%;">{{ cause_description }}</span></p>
    <p>4. Please provide the location and address where the illness or injury occurred: <span class="input-field" style="width: 95%;">{{ location_address }}</span></p>
    <p>5. Please provide the Responsible Party's information:</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p>1. Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ responsible_party_name }}</span></p>
      <p>2. Address: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ responsible_party_address }}</span></p>
      <p>3. Telephone Number: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ responsible_party_phone }}</span></p>
      <p>4. Insurance Company's Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ responsible_party_insurance_name }}</span></p>
      <p>5. Claim Number: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ responsible_party_claim_number }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>6. If you have hired an attorney to investigate or prosecute a claim related to your illness or injury, please provide your attorney's information:</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p>1. Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ attorney_name }}</span></p>
      <p>2. Address: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ attorney_address }}</span></p>
      <p>3. Telephone Number: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ attorney_phone }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>7. If you have any documents related to any investigation into how your injury occurred, please attach them.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>I have answered the above questions to the best of my ability. I understand that fraudulently answering any of these questions could result in the suspension or termination of my benefits. I further understand that I have an obligation to supplement any of the above responses should any of the information change in the future.</p>
    <p><strong>New York.</strong> Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud any insurance company or other person files an application for insurance or statement of claim containing any materially false information or conceals for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact material thereto commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime and subject to a civil penalty not to exceed five thousand dollars and the stated value of the claim for each such violation.</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
      <div>
        <p>Signature</p>
        <p>Print Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ signature_print_name_illness }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Date</p>
        <p><span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ signature_date_illness }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Lincoln Financial Group</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Lincoln Life & Annuity Company of New York</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">PO Box 2609, Omaha, NE 68103-2609</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Toll Free (800) 423-2765 Fax (877) 843-3950</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">LincolnFinancial.com</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">disabilityclaims@lfg.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 class="header-title">Long Term Disability Claim Form Physician's Statement</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>1. Patient Information</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p>First Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 200px;">{{ physician_patient_first_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Last Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 200px;">{{ physician_patient_last_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Height: <span class="input-field" style="width: 100px;">{{ physician_height }}</span></p>
      <p>Weight: <span class="input-field" style="width: 100px;">{{ physician_weight }}</span></p>
      <p>Blood Pressure: <span class="input-field" style="width: 200px;">{{ physician_bp }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <p>Social Security Number: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ physician_ssn }}</span></p>
    <p>Employer Name: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ physician_employer_name }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>2. Diagnosis</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p>Primary ICD diagnostic Code (Required): <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ primary_icd_code }}</span></p>
      <p>Primary ICD diagnosis Description: <span class="input-field" style="width: 400px;">{{ primary_icd_description }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p>Secondary ICD diagnostic Code: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ secondary_icd_code }}</span></p>
      <p>Secondary ICD Diagnosis Description: <span class="input-field" style="width: 400px;">{{ secondary_icd_description }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <p>Pregnancy: First Treated: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ pregnancy_first_treated }}</span> Estimated Delivery: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ pregnancy_delivery_date }}</span> Date of Delivery: <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ pregnancy_delivery_date_actual }}</span></p>
    <p>Symptoms: <span class="input-field" style="width: 95%;">{{ symptoms_description }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Objective Findings (Include copies of any x-rays, laboratory data, EKG's, MRI's, scans and any clinical findings):</p>
    <div style="height: 150px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>3. Disability Circumstances - Check if applicable</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p>Illness <input type="checkbox" name="disability_illness"> Injury <input type="checkbox" name="disability_injury"> Work Related <input type="checkbox" name="disability_work_related"></p>
    </div>
    <p>If work related or injury, summarize circumstances:</p>
    <div style="height: 100px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Date of: <span class="input-field" style="width: 200px;">{{ physician_statement_date }}</span></p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Symptoms first appeared: <span class="input-field" style="width: 200px;">{{ symptoms_start_date }}</span></p>
      <p>Reduced Ability to work: <span class="input-field" style="width: 200px;">{{ reduced_ability_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Initial Treatment: <span class="input-field" style="width: 200px;">{{ initial_treatment_date }}</span></p>
      <p>Most Recent Treatment: <span class="input-field" style="width: 200px;">{{ most_recent_treatment_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Next Treatment: <span class="input-field" style="width: 200px;">{{ next_treatment_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Dates hospital confined: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ hospital_confinement_dates }}</span> to</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>The Lincoln National Life Insurance Company is not responsible for charges incurred due to completion of this form. The patient is responsible for any charges associated with form completion.</p>
    <p>(Please see FRAUD NOTICES attached)</p>
    <p>Lincoln Financial Group is the marketing name for Lincoln National Corporation and its affiliates.</p>
    <p>Claim Submission Part 3 of 5</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Lincoln Financial Group</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Lincoln Life & Annuity Company of New York</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">PO Box 2609, Omaha, NE 68103-2609</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Toll Free (800) 423-2765 Fax (877) 843-3950</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">LincolnFinancial.com</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">disabilityclaims@lfg.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 class="header-title">4. Limitations and Restrictions</h2>
    <p>Restrictions (what the patient SHOULD NOT do):</p>
    <p>Limitations (what the patient CANNOT do):</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Indicate frequency per day the listed activities below can be used performed using:</p>
    <table class="table-row" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
      <thead>
        <tr class="table-header">
          <th style="width: 20%;">Lifting/Carrying</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Standing</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Crouching</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Reaching</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Overhead</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>1-5 lbs.</td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>6-10 lbs.</td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>11-25 lbs.</td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>26-50 lbs.</td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>51-100 lbs.</td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>100 + lbs.</td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>What job modifications would allow the patient to return to work?</p>
    <div style="height: 100px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Activities of Daily Living</p>
    <p>If patient cannot complete these activities of Daily Living indicate, when they were first unable to do so. (M/D/Y)</p>
    <table class="table-row" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
      <thead>
        <tr class="table-header">
          <th style="width: 20%;">Continence</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Dressing</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Transferring</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Eating</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
          <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;"></span></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>Date patient experienced loss of Cognitive Functioning: <span class="input-field" style="width: 300px;">{{ cognitive_loss_date }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>5. Treatment</p>
    <p>Describe current and recommended treatment plans including any completed or future surgeries. (Include dates):</p>
    <div style="height: 150px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>6. Prognosis</p>
